# AI-nimator controller bundle: a build artifact regenerated by
# apps/build/ from a --checkpoint, never versioned (ROADMAP_PLUGINS.md
# §2 vérité #9). Never commit a .onnx or any bundle file.
AInimator/Content/**
!AInimator/Content/.gitkeep

# Standard Unreal build/intermediate junk if a game project is ever
# scaffolded alongside this plugin for local testing.
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
